                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2d25531-126b-4505-ab9c-361b0854da73",
                                "sense_id": "1ef066b6-3355-3592-bf98-fadd268d2485",
                                "text": "prognosis is guarded"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "044b1cc6-34b0-3657-a06e-44f98a0836e7",
                        "entry_id": "036675f3-ee43-3f0e-8619-889dcf8bde4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Watched over; supervised."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3edb5b24-7fac-3e6c-9c65-411aa224b71c",
                        "entry_id": "036675f3-ee43-3f0e-8619-889dcf8bde4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a guard, e.g. a crossguard (on a sword), a faceguard (on a helmet), or a hatguard (on a chapeau)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb78f129-8be3-494c-bf0a-110c6f9932b3",
                                "sense_id": "3edb5b24-7fac-3e6c-9c65-411aa224b71c",
                                "text": "On the helmet , which is of gold, affrontee, guarded with perpendicular bars, and adorned with a mantled gules, doubled, or, is this crest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f9fab97-2f74-42fe-9314-b3a9ffedc161",
                                "sense_id": "3edb5b24-7fac-3e6c-9c65-411aa224b71c",
                                "text": "On a chapeau gules, guarded ermine, a gurnet (fish) urinant proper."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca10919c-80c6-441c-ae3c-c30f99f16a84",
                                "sense_id": "3edb5b24-7fac-3e6c-9c65-411aa224b71c",
                                "text": "Sable, an eagle displayed argent, crowned with an electoral bonnet gules, guarded argent (or ermine)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dc59e58-8c6a-4158-9ae8-dcbc205f4546",
                                "sense_id": "3edb5b24-7fac-3e6c-9c65-411aa224b71c",
                                "text": "Or, three swords in fess palewise azure, guarded vert, hilted gules; unidentified. Fouquet suggests that this is the device of the fictional king of Monteini, but notes that it might be the device of the fictional king of Bicheny."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8fe4cd32-18d9-464d-ba6b-c94e106c3387",
                        "source_entry_id": "036675f3-ee43-3f0e-8619-889dcf8bde4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "cautious",
                        "target_lang_word": "circonspect",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "circonspect",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d39e9f9-a858-3e61-a6e5-2a5a77cf8d93",
                                        "entry_id": "c7fc8c2b-d08c-3ae1-9bc4-36d140028104",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui prend garde à ce qu’il dit, à ce qu’il fait, en ayant égard aux circonstances, au milieu. Qui ne s’engage qu’après examen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0b2b73e-77c7-4131-81f8-83fdd49bb818",
                                                "sense_id": "6d39e9f9-a858-3e61-a6e5-2a5a77cf8d93",
                                                "text": "Les vieux, à ce propos, devinrent aussitôt circonspects, et demandèrent des explications."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37ce2a25-bd7f-4d32-adf7-a62615b624f0",
                                                "sense_id": "6d39e9f9-a858-3e61-a6e5-2a5a77cf8d93",
                                                "text": "Elle se tut, elle aussi, par une prudence de femme adonnée aux amours coupables, car les fautes comme l’innocence concourent à nous rendre circonspects."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9771761-cfc4-4a38-bfe8-7b9894694066",
                                                "sense_id": "6d39e9f9-a858-3e61-a6e5-2a5a77cf8d93",
                                                "text": "Si je partage, pour une large part, le tableau de notre situation actuelle qui est présentée dans cet essai, je demeure en revanche plus circonspect, voire franchement dubitatif, devant certaines solutions proposées aux problèmes de l'injustice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77d3b181-ca04-30e7-9d5e-66ebc2014867",
                                        "entry_id": "c7fc8c2b-d08c-3ae1-9bc4-36d140028104",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui marque de la circonspection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09683179-0b2e-410a-aa20-7324d20cebe6",
                                                "sense_id": "77d3b181-ca04-30e7-9d5e-66ebc2014867",
                                                "text": "Conduite, démarche circonspecte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "796f951d-190e-481a-b6b7-3d09ab4ad3ef",
                                                "sense_id": "77d3b181-ca04-30e7-9d5e-66ebc2014867",
                                                "text": "Langage circonspect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18c5f116-76db-453b-a842-1b3888f4bb45",
